  "title": "Wabtec Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Release Date",
  "summary": "PITTSBURGH, June 24, 2026 – Wabtec Corporation (NYSE: WAB) announced it will report 2026 second quarter results before the U.S. financial markets open on July 22, 2026. The company will conduct a conference call to discuss those results with analysts and investors at 8:30 a.m. ET the same day.",
